---

<section id="cta-final" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-primary border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_80%_at_80%_50%,rgba(255,255,255,0.10),transparent_60%)]"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 md:px-6 py-10 md:py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-6">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-sans text-[26px] md:text-[30px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight" style="letter-spacing:-0.02em;">¿Listo para dejar Excel atrás?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-white/85 max-w-[60ch]">Solicita acceso y lleva tu operación a una fuente única de verdad — del contenedor a la caja, con costo dual inmutable.</p>
      <div class="mt-3 hidden md:flex items-center gap-4 text-[12px] font-mono text-white/70">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80"></span>19 módulos trazables</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80"></span>Doble moneda CUP/USD</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80"></span>POS offline-first</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 shrink-0 items-center">
      <a href="/webimportcontrol/solicitud" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-11 px-7 rounded-full bg-white text-ink font-semibold text-[14px] hover:bg-page transition-colors shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.14)]">Solicitar acceso <svg class="ml-2" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a>
      <a href="#modulos" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-11 px-6 rounded-full border border-white/30 text-white font-medium text-[14px] hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">Ver módulos</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
